From: Hermes Agent <hermes@rgnv.dev>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:02:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] Phase 12: implement the 3374 native surface

Enumerate the complete 3374 native gap offline (49 entries) and implement all of
it: Core RandRange/FloatToFormattedString/IsUTracing/SetUTracing/GetModName/
AllPackageFiles, Engine UObjectPool plus 18 Actor/Pawn/Projectile/LevelInfo/
GameInfo functions, IpDrv NetworkConnect and MasterServerClientLauncher,
XInterface NotifyMenuStatus/GetFontB, and the Onslaught native classes.

Add WASM_VERIFY_NATIVES so a missing export, native class constructor or
unregistered iNative logs and continues instead of aborting at the first one.

3369 data still boots to clean exit; 3374 now binds every native and stops later
at package/C++ property-layout drift (57 native classes), documented in
CHANGES-wasm-port.md.
